{"block_id": "ch25-b0001", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "417a7fff45b2619c", "translated": "图 25.1 如何使用 Google Cloud Console 访问 AgentSpace", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:23:20.201586", "block_id": "ch25-b0001", "chapter_id": 25, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 510, "output_tokens": 15, "elapsed_sec": 2.51, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch25-b0002", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "37894c649876eff7", "translated": "您的智能体(Agent)可以连接多种服务,包括 Calendar、Google Mail、Workday、Jira、Outlook 以及 Service Now(参见图 25.2)。\n\n![图 25.2 AgentSpace 与多样化服务集成](svg/fig-25-2.svg)\n\n*图 25.2 与多样化服务集成,包括 Google 及第三方平台*", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:23:21.947090", "block_id": "ch25-b0002", "chapter_id": 25, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 434, "output_tokens": 74, "elapsed_sec": 1.74, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch25-b0003", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "0a37d49154135b7e", "translated": "智能体随后可以使用自己的提示(Prompt),从 Google 提供的预制提示库中选择,如图 25.3 所示。\n\n图 25.3 Google 的预制提示库", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:23:23.508406", "block_id": "ch25-b0003", "chapter_id": 25, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4429, "output_tokens": 38, "elapsed_sec": 1.56, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch25-b0004", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "892eae5cd953e7e9", "translated": "或者,你也可以按图 25.4 所示自行创建提示,该提示随后将被你的智能体使用。\n\nAgentSpace 还提供了诸多高级特性,例如与用于存储自有数据的数据存储集成、与 Google Knowledge Graph 或你自己的私有 Knowledge Graph 集成、用于将你的智能体暴露到 Web 的 Web 界面,以及用于监控使用情况的分析功能等(见图 25.5)。\n\n完成后,即可访问 AgentSpace 的聊天界面(图 25.6)。\n\n图 25.4 自定义智能体的提示", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:23:25.416184", "block_id": "ch25-b0004", "chapter_id": 25, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4487, "output_tokens": 105, "elapsed_sec": 1.91, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch25-b0005", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "d43d18d709aa394f", "translated": "**图 25.5** AgentSpace 高级能力\n\n**图 25.6** 用于启动与你的智能体对话的 AgentSpace 用户界面", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:23:26.566296", "block_id": "ch25-b0005", "chapter_id": 25, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 405, "output_tokens": 33, "elapsed_sec": 1.15, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch25-b0006", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "475acaf0bdb6a03c", "translated": "## 结论\n\n综上所述,AgentSpace 提供了一个实用的框架,用于在组织现有的数字基础设施内开发和部署人工智能智能体(Agent)。该系统的架构将复杂的后端流程(如自主推理和企业知识图谱映射)与用于构建智能体的图形用户界面相连接。通过该界面,用户可以通过集成各种数据服务并通过提示(Prompt)定义其操作参数来配置智能体,从而构建定制的、具备上下文感知能力的自动化系统。\n\n这种方法抽象了底层的技术复杂性,使得构建专业化的多智能体系统无需深厚的编程专业知识。其主要目标是将自动化分析和运营能力直接嵌入到工作流(Workflow)中,从而提升流程效率并增强数据驱动的分析能力。为了获得实践指导,可以使用动手学习模块,例如 Google Cloud Skills Boost 上的 \"Build a Gen AI Agent with Agentspace\" 实验,该模块为技能学习提供了结构化的环境。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:23:30.625735", "block_id": "ch25-b0006", "chapter_id": 25, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 722, "output_tokens": 175, "elapsed_sec": 4.06, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch25-b0007", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "c5159241717fcb82", "translated": "## 参考文献\n\nCreate a no-code agent with Agent Designer, https://cloud.google.com/agentspace/\n  agentspace-­enterprise/docs/agent-­designer\nGoogle Cloud Skills Boost, https://www.cloudskillsboost.google/", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:23:32.023686", "block_id": "ch25-b0007", "chapter_id": 25, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4377, "output_tokens": 49, "elapsed_sec": 1.4, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244747.350664}}
